# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. Vite loads .env.local automatically.

# Groq API key for Whisper large-v3 transcription (used by the Waiata
# Try-singing button). Sign up at https://console.groq.com/keys.
#
# NOTE: any VITE_-prefixed variable is bundled into the client at build
# time, so this key WILL be visible to anyone who inspects the deployed
# JavaScript. That is acceptable for a classroom prototype but must be
# replaced with a small backend proxy (Cloudflare Worker, Vercel
# Function, ...) before any real deployment.
VITE_GROQ_API_KEY=
